flowchart LR
  Q[User operational question] --> I[Intent policy]
  I --> E[Required evidence tools]
  K[Known-good config and memory] --> D[Delta comparison]
  C[Fresh console and prior results] --> D
  E --> O[Current observations]
  O --> D
  D --> X{Conflict or new abnormality?}
  X -->|yes| F[Smallest fault domain]
  X -->|no| B[Next unobserved boundary]
  F --> R[Recommended fix or test]
  R --> V[Validation and rollback]
  B --> V
